  intro: "Your refund is what your employer withheld (W-2 box 2) minus your 2026 federal tax after credits. This estimate uses the 2026 standard deduction and brackets and the child tax credit of up to $2,200 a child, of which up to $1,700 can be refunded even if you owe no tax.",
